<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Anti-jump test (Course.demo: hole 1 tee = 25.00100, 121.00000).
  GPS jitters ±~5 m around the hole-1 tee for ~40 s and NEVER dwells in
  the hole-2 geofence (hole 2 tee is ~111 m away). The round must stay on
  hole 1 the entire time — proves the geofence lock rejects noise.

  Use:  Xcode ▸ run ▸ Debug ▸ Simulate Location ▸ (add this file).
  Expect: "第 1 洞" never changes; 0 hole jumps.
-->
